const WTN={heavy:'重甲',medium:'中甲',light:'輕甲'},WKN={'1h':'單手','2h':'雙手',dual:'雙持'},OKN={shield:'盾牌',tome:'法器'};
const typeTag=it=>it.wt?WTN[it.wt]:it.wk?WKN[it.wk]:it.ok?OKN[it.ok]:'';
const WNAME={heavy:{h:['鐵面盔','碑石重盔'],s:['鉚釘肩鎧','骨殼巨肩'],a:['鏈甲','墓守重鎧'],g:['鐵指手甲','碑石重拳套'],f:['鐵頭靴','墓守戰靴']},medium:{h:['鉚釘兜帽','鴉嘴半盔'],s:['皮革護肩','夜郵肩甲'],a:['鑲片皮甲','守夜人外套'],g:['皮護手','夜郵手甲'],f:['綁腿短靴','守夜人長靴']},light:{h:['紗面巾','夢紗頭巾'],s:['布肩帶','霧紗披肩'],a:['旅人外衣','夢紗長袍'],g:['絲手套','霧紗手套'],f:['布履','夢紗輕履']},'1h':{w:['舊短劍','燈芯細劍']},'2h':{w:['伐木巨斧','碑石大劍']},dual:{w:['雙刺','雙生鴉爪']}};
function applyType(it){const t=it.t,s=it.s;
 if(['h','s','a','g','f'].includes(s)){const r=Math.random();it.wt=r<.3?'heavy':r<.7?'medium':'light';const body=s==='a';
  if(it.wt==='heavy'){it.def=Math.max(it.def+1,Math.round(it.def*1.4));it.at.spd=(it.at.spd||0)-(body?2:1);if(body)it.at.dex=(it.at.dex||0)-1}
  if(it.wt==='light'){it.def=Math.round(it.def*.7);if(body||s==='f')it.at.spd=(it.at.spd||0)+1;else it.at.dex=(it.at.dex||0)+1}}
 if(s==='w'){const r=Math.random();it.wk=r<.5?'1h':r<.8?'2h':'dual';if(it.wk==='2h'){it.atk=Math.round(it.atk*1.5);it.at.spd=(it.at.spd||0)-1}if(it.wk==='dual'){it.atk=Math.round(it.atk*.8);it.at.dex=(it.at.dex||0)+1}}
 if(s==='o'){it.ok=GBASE.o[t-1].indexOf(it.n)===1?'tome':'shield';if(it.ok==='shield'){it.def=[2,4,6,9,12][t-1];it.blk=+(.04+t*.02).toFixed(2);it.at.spd=(it.at.spd||0)-1}else{it.pw=+(.04*t).toFixed(2);it.at.int=(it.at.int||0)+t}}
 {const W=WNAME[it.wt||it.wk];if(W&&W[s]&&Math.random()<.4)it.n=W[s][t>=3?1:0]}
 for(const k of ATR)if(it.at[k]===0)delete it.at[k];return it}
function genItem(t,rb=0,slot){if(t>=4&&RUN&&RUN.floor>=10&&!RUN.abyss&&Math.random()<.6)t=5;t=Math.max(1,Math.min(5,t));const s=slot||pick(ITYPES);const roll=Math.random()*100+rb;const r=roll>98?3:roll>88?2:roll>60?1:0;
 const it={u:S.gid++,s,t,r,n:pick(GBASE[s][t-1]),atk:0,def:0,at:{}};
 if(s==='w')it.atk=[3,7,12,18,26][t-1]+rnd(0,t);
 if(s==='h'){it.def=[1,2,3,5,7][t-1];it.at.vit=t}
 if(s==='s'){it.def=[1,2,4,6,8][t-1];it.at.str=t}
 if(s==='a')it.def=[2,4,7,10,14][t-1]+rnd(0,t-1);
 if(s==='g'){it.atk=[1,3,5,8,11][t-1];it.at.dex=t}
 if(s==='f'){it.def=[0,1,1,2,3][t-1];it.at.spd=[1,2,3,4,5][t-1]}
 if(s==='r'){const k=pick(ATR);it.at[k]=[1,2,3,5,7][t-1]}
 if(s==='n'){const k=pick(ATR);it.at[k]=[2,3,5,7,10][t-1]}
 const pool=shuffle([...ATR,'atk','def','crit','crr','luk','drop','pres','mres','ls','acc','thn','cres','ares']);it.x={};for(let i=0;i<r;i++){const k=pool[i];if(k==='atk')it.atk+=rnd(1,t*2);else if(k==='def')it.def+=rnd(1,t);else if(XN[k])it.x[k]=+(XR[k]*(rnd(5,10)/10)*t).toFixed(3);else it.at[k]=(it.at[k]||0)+rnd(1,t+1)}
 return applyType(it)}
